<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>03 / 单题引擎</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>改题：从整体判断转向逐步对照</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#E8A33D' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>部分实现</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={1140} height={250} viewBox='0 0 1140 250'><rect x='0' y='0' width='555' height='250' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA'/><rect x='585' y='0' width='555' height='250' rx='8' fill='#EAF3FD'/><text x='277.5' y='34' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>整体判断（旧）</text><text x='862.5' y='34' font-size='20' fill='#1E7BE0' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>逐步对照（新）</text><circle cx='28' cy='68' r='4' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='44' y='74' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>只知道最终答案错误</text><circle cx='28' cy='102' r='4' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='44' y='108' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>据此推断学生不理解列式所用知识</text><circle cx='28' cy='136' r='4' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='44' y='142' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>反馈笼统：这道题没掌握</text><circle cx='28' cy='170' r='4' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='44' y='176' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>无法定位到具体哪一步</text><circle cx='613' cy='68' r='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='629' y='74' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>逐段作答对应到参考步骤</text><circle cx='613' cy='102' r='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='629' y='108' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>识别：列式正确，化简出错</text><circle cx='613' cy='136' r='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='629' y='142' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>定位到化简步骤而非列式步骤</text><circle cx='613' cy='170' r='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='629' y='176' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>反馈具体：这一步的运算有问题</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #0E2340', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>设计目标：说清楚“哪一步、哪段作答、什么问题”，而不是给出一个笼统的对错判断</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：单题功能设计思路.md §3.1</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 25 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>